WEBVTT

01:00.100 --> 01:02.900
=Daughter of Fortune=

01:02.900 --> 01:05.460
(Adapted from the novel
"Phoenix Palace Dream" by Lan Jiujiu)

01:05.540 --> 01:08.490
=Episode 4=

01:08.490 --> 01:11.320
(Bamboo Dew Spring)

01:11.320 --> 01:12.640
Then do you know

01:13.320 --> 01:14.600
who I am?

01:16.160 --> 01:17.600
Of course I do.

01:19.720 --> 01:22.200
Nangong Xuanyu.

01:29.880 --> 01:32.360
Nangong Xuanyu is the most

01:32.680 --> 01:33.400
powerful

01:34.000 --> 01:35.800
and formidable man in the world.

01:36.560 --> 01:37.320
Oh, yes.

01:38.120 --> 01:39.640
You treated me to wine today.

01:40.240 --> 01:41.840
I'll treat you next time.

01:42.400 --> 01:43.760
We'll drink

01:44.080 --> 01:44.840
flower wine.

01:45.480 --> 01:46.480
Flower wine?

01:47.000 --> 01:47.760
Mm.

01:50.120 --> 01:52.080
Whatever flower you like,

01:52.480 --> 01:54.840
I'll brew wine from it for you.

02:14.840 --> 02:15.760
Magnolia.

02:16.640 --> 02:18.400
Magnolia.

02:21.000 --> 02:21.840
Your Ladyship.

02:22.200 --> 02:23.440
Ahead is the wine cellar.

02:26.920 --> 02:28.320
Don't leave me behind.

02:30.320 --> 02:31.800
I'll teach you another lesson.

02:31.800 --> 02:34.000
A wise man stays away from danger.

02:34.000 --> 02:35.520
Jerk.

02:55.660 --> 02:56.920
Didn't you say someone was here?

02:57.040 --> 02:57.640
Where is he?

03:03.560 --> 03:04.160
Your Majesty.

03:04.680 --> 03:06.040
You said touching her

03:06.440 --> 03:08.480
eases the burning pain inside you.

03:08.960 --> 03:11.720
Then why not keep her as a living cure?

03:12.840 --> 03:15.000
That would only worsen the problem.

03:16.120 --> 03:18.360
How did she find out my identity?

03:19.120 --> 03:20.640
Go investigate it thoroughly.

03:21.160 --> 03:21.840
Yes.

03:26.520 --> 03:27.960
I entered the palace

03:29.000 --> 03:31.440
to marry the greatest man

03:32.480 --> 03:34.720
and claim the highest power.

03:35.720 --> 03:36.640
(Shen Zhinian.)

03:38.040 --> 03:39.720
(If you want power,)

03:40.200 --> 03:42.190
(that depends on
whether you have the fate for it.)

03:43.480 --> 03:45.160
(That wine was way too strong.)

03:45.320 --> 03:47.120
(My head hurts so much.)

03:47.520 --> 03:49.320
(What exactly happened last night?)

03:49.640 --> 03:51.720
(Why did I sleep inside a wine vat?)

03:52.280 --> 03:54.360
(Find a eunuch's outfit
for me to change into.)

03:54.370 --> 03:56.120
(I should be able to return
to Tinglan Palace without being noticed.)

03:56.120 --> 03:58.280
Young Master,
there's an injured sparrow over there.

04:02.180 --> 04:05.620
(Jiang Chen,
eldest legitimate son of Duke Zhen)

04:06.080 --> 04:06.800
Let's go.

04:07.080 --> 04:08.400
We'll be late for court.

04:09.040 --> 04:10.240
Take it back and nurse it well.

04:32.440 --> 04:34.160
This young eunuch has a hangover

04:34.160 --> 04:35.320
and caught a chill as well.

04:35.480 --> 04:37.200
I'll prescribe him
some medicine shortly.

04:38.240 --> 04:39.200
Thank you, my lord.

04:43.480 --> 04:44.640
Please, my lord, you mustn't.

04:45.000 --> 04:45.760
It's alright.

04:47.760 --> 04:49.080
Which palace do you serve in?

04:49.180 --> 04:50.840
I'll have someone deliver the medicine

04:50.840 --> 04:51.480
to you later.

04:51.800 --> 04:53.590
There's no need
to trouble yourself, my lord.

04:53.600 --> 04:55.040
I'll come collect it myself.

04:56.080 --> 04:57.040
You're quite fortunate.

04:57.160 --> 04:58.080
Everyone knows

04:58.080 --> 04:59.280
Lord Jiang of the Duke's Manor

04:59.440 --> 05:00.880
has a truly kind heart.

05:01.000 --> 05:02.400
You shouldn't refuse.

05:04.680 --> 05:05.440
Lord Jiang.

05:07.360 --> 05:09.720
(So he's Jiang Chen,
the Duke's eldest son.)

05:10.000 --> 05:11.510
If you're worried about being punished,

05:11.520 --> 05:12.440
I'll escort you back.

05:12.450 --> 05:14.760
That way your mistress
won't make things difficult for you.

05:15.360 --> 05:16.160
Thank you, my lord.

05:22.100 --> 05:23.800
Senior Attendant,
you've finally returned.

05:25.360 --> 05:26.360
What did she call you?

05:28.320 --> 05:29.160
My surname is Chang.

05:29.280 --> 05:30.920
They all call me Eunuch Chang.

05:32.280 --> 05:32.920
Eunuch Chang.

05:38.520 --> 05:39.320
Thank you.

05:44.400 --> 05:46.360
Miss, forget about Lord Jiang for now.

05:46.360 --> 05:47.920
Last night, Fengqi Palace sent word

05:47.920 --> 05:49.800
that you were
to pay respects to the Empress

05:49.800 --> 05:51.120
this morning at chen hour.

05:51.120 --> 05:51.840
Chen hour?

05:51.840 --> 05:53.480
It's already a quarter past chen hour.

05:53.480 --> 05:54.640
Why didn't you tell me sooner?

05:54.640 --> 05:55.080
Quick.

05:55.080 --> 05:56.050
Prepare the bath and dressing.

05:56.060 --> 05:59.020
(Fengqi Palace)

06:09.520 --> 06:10.880
Greetings, Your Ladyship.

06:11.240 --> 06:12.160
Lady Liu.

06:12.600 --> 06:13.440
Shen Zhinian.

06:14.040 --> 06:16.000
I thought you'd built your own kingdom

06:16.320 --> 06:17.680
and stopped showing up to court.

06:19.280 --> 06:20.200
I would never dare.

06:20.720 --> 06:21.520
I...

06:23.200 --> 06:25.080
I merely caught a chill.

06:25.960 --> 06:27.280
Last night, I already sent word.

06:27.600 --> 06:29.800
If you couldn't come,
why didn't you report it earlier?

06:30.160 --> 06:32.000
On my way here, I became dizzy

06:32.000 --> 06:32.920
and fell.

06:33.520 --> 06:35.080
My clothes were stained with dirt,

06:35.390 --> 06:36.440
so I went back to change.

06:36.440 --> 06:37.430
That's why I arrived late.

06:37.440 --> 06:39.920
The Empress has arrived.

06:44.560 --> 06:46.440
Greetings, Your Majesty.

06:47.460 --> 06:51.420
(Empress Jiang Jin,
eldest legitimate daughter of Duke Zhen)

06:59.640 --> 07:00.560
Be seated.

07:00.570 --> 07:02.580
- Thank you, Your Majesty.
- Thank you, Your Majesty.

07:10.280 --> 07:11.840
Senior Attendant Rou is still unwell.

07:12.160 --> 07:12.960
You may rise.

07:18.440 --> 07:19.760
Thank you, Your Majesty.

07:23.800 --> 07:25.400
Your Ladyship oversees the six palaces.

07:25.400 --> 07:26.160
You've worked hard.

07:26.700 --> 07:28.540
His Majesty's
birthday banquet is approaching.

07:28.760 --> 07:29.960
How are the preparations?

07:32.920 --> 07:34.400
Everything has been prepared.

07:34.480 --> 07:35.760
Please review them, Your Majesty.

07:37.440 --> 07:39.920
I'm only worried that
Your Majesty's health is too delicate

07:40.800 --> 07:42.320
to read through so many pages.

07:53.720 --> 07:55.200
All of you may leave.

07:56.120 --> 07:57.340
Senior Attendant Rou stays behind.

07:58.080 --> 07:58.880
Help me

07:59.040 --> 08:00.280
read through this register.

08:04.720 --> 08:05.520
Yes.

08:16.320 --> 08:17.920
Your Ladyship has quite the temper.

08:18.200 --> 08:21.040
Sit for a while before leaving,
lest she makes things difficult for you.

08:22.560 --> 08:24.120
Thank you, Your Majesty.

08:27.720 --> 08:28.720
Your Ladyship said

08:28.730 --> 08:31.490
since Senior Attendant Rou is so eager
to ease Her Majesty's burdens,

08:31.500 --> 08:33.460
you are to uproot every flower
in Shanglin Garden

08:33.600 --> 08:34.400
and replace them all

08:34.400 --> 08:35.960
with the peonies Her Majesty favors.

08:36.080 --> 08:37.600
If you fail to finish before sunset,

08:37.610 --> 08:39.380
you will be punished
according to palace rules.

08:45.320 --> 08:46.680
Lord Jiang has arrived.

08:54.720 --> 08:55.680
Your Majesty.

08:56.920 --> 08:59.360
The foreign envoys have all
been settled at Wenhua Inn.

08:59.920 --> 09:02.440
I came to ask whether Your Majesty
wishes to receive them.

09:03.120 --> 09:04.520
You were late today.

09:06.240 --> 09:08.720
I came across a sick young eunuch
in Shanglin Garden

09:08.750 --> 09:10.380
and took him
to the Imperial Medical Bureau.

09:10.400 --> 09:11.290
That's what delayed me.

09:12.240 --> 09:13.400
In this world,

09:14.160 --> 09:15.120
kindness

09:15.520 --> 09:17.000
doesn't always get rewarded.

09:17.520 --> 09:19.160
Since you've chosen to help others,

09:19.800 --> 09:21.240
there's no need to expect gratitude.

09:25.200 --> 09:25.840
Your Majesty.

09:26.000 --> 09:27.320
Duke Zhen requests an audience.

09:31.960 --> 09:33.160
I'll take my leave first.

09:33.440 --> 09:35.320
Otherwise Father will nag at me again.

09:47.960 --> 09:50.200
Greets, Your Majesty.

09:50.920 --> 09:52.040
Rise, Duke.

09:52.660 --> 09:57.100
(Duke Zhen)

09:58.110 --> 10:00.440
Wan Ning entered the palace today
to accompany the Empress.

10:01.000 --> 10:03.160
Your Majesty watched Wan Ning grow up.

10:03.760 --> 10:05.560
I hope you will look after her.

10:08.040 --> 10:08.960
I understand.

10:13.040 --> 10:15.000
More than ten years have flown by.

10:15.520 --> 10:16.880
Back then, Your Majesty

10:17.120 --> 10:18.960
wasn't even as tall as Wan Ning is now.

10:20.000 --> 10:21.040
In those days,

10:21.040 --> 10:22.160
it was me

10:22.160 --> 10:23.680
who personally carried Your Majesty

10:23.680 --> 10:25.280
out of the dog kennel.

10:28.360 --> 10:29.880
Bark like a dog and you'll get food.

10:30.400 --> 10:32.120
No barking, no food.

10:32.680 --> 10:34.360
No barking, no food.

10:36.360 --> 10:37.720
Hurry and bark.

10:41.160 --> 10:43.400
Duke Zhen saved my life.

10:44.160 --> 10:45.880
I have never forgotten it.

10:47.880 --> 10:50.600
I only hope that Your Majesty and I

10:50.600 --> 10:52.400
will always remain one family.

11:09.700 --> 11:12.740
(Jiang Wanning, Fourth Young Lady
of the Duke's Manor)

11:17.220 --> 11:20.060
(Yuehui Pavilion)

11:29.540 --> 11:30.800
Miss, why don't you rest a bit?

11:30.800 --> 11:31.840
Leave the planting to me.

11:32.200 --> 11:33.120
It's fine.

11:33.560 --> 11:34.280
Let's work faster

11:35.120 --> 11:37.320
and finish before dark.

11:39.520 --> 11:40.400
Sister.

11:43.120 --> 11:45.680
(Whenever Liu Ruyan appears,
nothing good follows.)

11:49.160 --> 11:50.120
Lady Liu.

11:50.640 --> 11:53.440
I heard Your Ladyship punished you
by making you plant flowers.

11:53.920 --> 11:55.320
In the dead of winter,

11:55.320 --> 11:56.640
how can anything grow?

11:57.320 --> 11:59.400
You and I have suffered together before,

11:59.640 --> 12:00.760
so I came to help you.

12:16.180 --> 12:17.620
(Yuehui Pavilion)

12:24.240 --> 12:25.080
Sister.

12:25.720 --> 12:27.520
How do you use this hoe?

12:28.600 --> 12:29.720
Why don't you...

12:30.000 --> 12:30.520
Don't.

12:36.640 --> 12:37.680
Who's there?

12:48.900 --> 12:54.020
♪Broken dreams,
listening to the light rain♪

12:55.740 --> 13:00.980
♪Bitter cold, bringing mist to the eyes♪

13:02.620 --> 13:04.980
♪If we don't meet♪

13:05.180 --> 13:08.420
♪Flowers bloom and fall in shame♪

13:08.620 --> 13:15.140
♪If we meet again,
the peaches will be warm♪

13:15.500 --> 13:21.940
♪Spring breeze passes,
dancing through the years♪

13:22.300 --> 13:28.620
♪Brewing longing,
remembering past lives♪

13:29.140 --> 13:35.820
♪Hard to meet, and just as hard to part♪

13:35.820 --> 13:42.700
♪Who planted the beans
that grew into lotuses?♪

13:42.940 --> 13:48.820
♪Spring breeze passes,
composing the fleeting years♪

13:49.740 --> 13:56.340
♪Clouds on Mount Wu,
no sails on the sea♪

13:56.500 --> 14:03.180
♪Wanting to fold my heart
into a paper kite♪

14:03.460 --> 14:09.900
♪But the ties are too tangled to sever♪
